   "text": "Isolation: API/DB never touch sandboxes \u00b7 worker never runs task code \u00b7 runner sees only 3 secrets \u00b7 each task in its own microVM.\nResilience: if a worker dies its lease expires, another worker resumes from the last checkpoint; orphan sandboxes are reaped.\nTenancy: every query is scoped by organisation; admins see all org jobs, members only their own; foreign ids return 404.",
